     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "It seems like someone already updated sha1 to sha in the places where it needed to be (examples of digest terms that can be used in requests).",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I didn't end up making any modifications to ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA5x/Fixity+Checking"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA5x/Fixity+Checking",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " because the references there were to SHA-1 as an algorithm rather than a parameter.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Didn't see any other documents that needed updating. So basically I didn't do anything but this seems to be done.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
