     "body": "<p>It seems like someone already updated sha1 to sha in the places where it needed to be (examples of digest terms that can be used in requests).</p>\n\n<p>I didn't end up making any modifications to <a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA5x/Fixity+Checking\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA5x/Fixity+Checking</a> because the references there were to SHA-1 as an algorithm rather than a parameter.</p>\n\n<p>Didn't see any other documents that needed updating. So basically I didn't do anything but this seems to be done.</p>",
